th a diverse bonding system to get  closer to the girls you like and  increase your relationships with them  and don't forget you get to run your own  virtual cafe with them as well it's a  game that combines many different genres  and systems but you know what it's like  they cherry picked all the little things  i look for and put them into one game  you'll be dodging bullets one moment and  then patting your wife whose head the  next so really what more can you ask for  if like me this looks like everything  you want in the game then click the link  in the description to try it out today  you can also use the code on screen  right now for free gifts thank you again  to girl cafe gun for sponsoring today's  video and with that said let's go back  to talking about oshinoko it's one of  those titles that is worth giving a  chance just because of the names behind  it coming from the same artist that did  scum's wish written by the mangaka of  kagi osama because while still writing  and drawing kagiasama doing a weekly  serialized manga which is famous for  pushing many artists to their limits aka  akasaka was just like  let's start another one  but despite the names behind it you  wouldn't be able to get what this manga  is about just by reading the synopsis or  the beginning i mean this was my  experience reading chapter one okay so  we've got some idol story here that's  cool and um  what the [ __ ] gynecologist what the [ __ ]  teen pregnancy what the [ __ ] he's  already dead  what the [ __ ] he's the baby now  what yeah you heard that right the main  character is an idol obsessed  gynecologist who finds out that his  favorite idol is pregnant promises he's  gonna deliver the baby then gets [ __ ]  murdered by one of her obsessed fans and  that gets reborn as a [ __ ] baby i say  again  what the [ __ ] i thought i was getting  some idol manga then by the end of  chapter one i had enough physical  whiplash to give me neck problems but  then the babies have memories